/Title (innovators through academic excellence, cutting-edge research, technological innovation, and strong industry engagement. The School offers a dynamic learning environment that integrates core software principles with experiential learning, project-based pedagogy, hands-on lab interactions, industrial internships, and research-driven technical education. With a strong emphasis on professional ethics, data privacy, tech leadership, digital transformation, and technical entrepreneurship, the School prepares students to excel in an evolving global technology landscape. The institution actively promotes interdisciplinary research, industry collaborations, open-source initiatives, consultancy, and global academic partnerships to enhance knowledge creation, technological advancement, and societal impact.)
